### ============================================================
### 01-auth-jwt.http — Autenticación, JWT y tiempo restante
### ============================================================
### Endpoint: POST /api/auth   (login)
### Endpoint: GET  /api/auth/tiempo (tiempo restante del token)
### ============================================================
### ANTES DE EJECUTAR: ajusta las variables según tus usuarios de desarrollo.
### Nunca uses credenciales reales ni de producción.
### ============================================================
@baseUrl       = http://localhost:3000
@adminEmail    = usuarioAdmin@example.com
@adminPassword = 123456
@userEmail     = usuarioNormal@example.com
@userPassword  = 123456

### ── LOGIN CORRECTO ─────────────────────────────────────────

###
# Esperado: 200 OK — { email, nombre, rol, jwt }
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
# Esperado: 200 OK — { email, nombre, rol, jwt }
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{userEmail}}",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

### ── LOGIN FALLIDO ───────────────────────────────────────────

###
# Esperado: 401 Unauthorized — contraseña incorrecta (mensaje genérico)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "Contraseña_Incorrecta_99"
}

###
# Esperado: 401 Unauthorized — login rechazado con mensaje genérico
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "no-es-un-email",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

###
# Esperado: 400 Bad Request — solicitud invalida
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{}

###
# Esperado: 400 Bad Request — solicitud inválida por contraseña demasiado larga
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
    "password": "Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
}

###
# Esperado: 415 Unsupported Media Type — Content-Type incorrecto
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: text/plain
Accept: application/json

email=admin&password=Admin123

### ── TIEMPO RESTANTE DEL TOKEN ────────────────────────────────

###
# Esperado: 200 OK — responde con tiempo en formato MM:SS
# Requiere ejecutar loginAdmin primero en esta sesión REST Client
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/tiempo
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.jwt}}

###
# Esperado: 401 Unauthorized — Acceso no autorizado (sin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/tiempo
Accept: text/plain

###
# Esperado: 401 Unauthorized — Acceso no autorizado (token inventado / firma inválida)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/tiempo
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0In0.firma_invalida_aqui

###
# Esperado: 401 Unauthorized — Acceso no autorizado (header Authorization mal formado (sin Bearer))
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/tiempo
Accept: text/plain
Authorization: Token algoquenoesbearer
